    // the thread that loads it: the main loop has no cross-thread reuse,
    // so the kernel issues direct vectorized global loads -- B with an
    // evict_last L2 policy, A rows as streaming .cs loads -- straight
    // into registers, keeping only the 1KB row-sum reduction buffer in
    // shared memory. The K loop is unrolled by two batches: each thread
