    // intra-warp shuffle reduction followed by a tiny 4-warp merge.
    // This keeps the two row partials in registers for the log2(32)
    // reduction steps, removes most bar.sync latency from the epilogue,
    // and still leaves only thread 0 to perform the split-K atomics.
